WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:08.960
All rights for this production are reserved to the copyright holder, and distribution 
is permitted only to its intended audience. Unauthorized reproduction, screening, 
display, or modification of this program's content is strictly prohibited 
by law, and violation is grounds for criminal and civil prosecution.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:16.820
Dio!

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.200
Come here!

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.200
Dio! Are you deaf, boy?!

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:28.880
What do you want, Father? Medicine?

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.450
Idiot! I don't want any snake oil!

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:36.360
If you have money,
go buy me some booze!

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:39.870
Stop! Give it back!

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:43.840
Your dad makes a lot of money
for being a quack!

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:44.730
I know!

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:48.330
Let's peel her clothes off!

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:51.230
We'll see if it looks like
the real thing!

00:00:55.020 --> 00:01:00.090
She cried!
Erina's a crybaby!

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:00.950
Knock it off!

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:03.530
Give it back to her!

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.710
Who're you?

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:05.960
Erina's friend?

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:09.480
I don't know her,
but I'll fight for her!

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:15.840
You dumb jerk.
Fighting 'cause she's a girl.

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:20.550
Huh? He's a total pushover!

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:28.940
How embarrassing!
Now our brave knight needs saving!

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:35.440
This guy's the only son of the Joestars!

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:38.150
You stuck up snob!

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:40.030
Have some of this!

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:43.960
Dio, my time is almost up.

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:45.500
Listen!

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:52.750
When I die, take this letter
to the Joestar mansion!

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:55.760
They owe me something big.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:02.390
You're a smart boy. Go out there
and become the world's richest man!

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:08.220
Just stay on your own land, rich kid.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:09.190
Let's go.

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:15.850
Are you --

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:17.110
Just leave me alone!

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:22.490
Go away!
I didn't attack them for your sake!

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.910
I want to be a true gentleman!

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:29.780
You were a lady in distress.

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:37.590
A true gentleman has to be brave enough
to go into a fight he knows he'll lose.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:42.210
But one day,
I'll be strong enough to win.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.380
You were ugly and sly.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:51.270
You drove Mom to death.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.980
You were a terrible father!

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:55.820
You want me to be rich?

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.820
Don't worry. I will be.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:00.740
And I'll use any means necessary.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.700
I'll start with this Joestar.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:05.620
You pig!

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:10.790
No one will bring me down.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.440
Jonathan Joestar.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:29.270
This is a tale of two youths and
a stone mask that alters their fates.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:48.830
Two stars fallen from the heavens

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:56.020
Swallowed by waters swirling
light and dark

00:03:56.020 --> 00:04:01.300
Their ripples move outward,
pulled toward each other

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:12.440
The sun will guide the man
who walks the path of honor

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:18.150
And for the man who follows
his ambition...

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.150
...a sacrifice awaits

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:30.290
With pounding heart
and burning will

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:34.070
With thundering fists

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:37.490
And overflowing bravery

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:44.130
He steps forward, free of doubt

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.750
A fate determined by his blood

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:52.140
JoJo!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:09.010
Part 1: Phantom Blood

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:27.890
Who is he?

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:31.640
You're Dio Brando, right?

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.640
And you must be Jonathan Joestar.

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:38.630
Everyone calls me JoJo.
Nice to meet you.

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:40.900
Danny!

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:44.250
See him? That's Danny.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.660
He's my dog.

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:48.570
Don't worry.
He doesn't bite.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:55.260
Hey!
You'll pay for that!

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:57.750
So this is the Joestar heir.

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:01.090
He looks like a pampered brat.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:05.410
We'll see who has it all
after I get through with him.

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:06.340
What's the matter?

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:10.640
What's going on here?

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:15.140
I'm sorry. The dog jumped at me.
It was a reflex.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.270
Welcome, Dio.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.270
You are part of our family now.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:29.060
Everyone, I owe my life
to this man's father.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:31.740
Treat him as you would JoJo.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.200
Yes, lord.

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:38.120
Dio, this is your home now.
Live like JoJo does.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.630
Thank you for your hospitality,
Sir Joestar.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:46.270
You've both lost your mothers
and you're the same age.

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:48.520
You should get along well.

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:51.640
JoJo, forget about Danny, all right?

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:52.050
Yes, Dad.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:58.310
I'm sure I'd be surprised if a strange
dog jumped at me, so I understand.

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:02.330
I do wish he'd apologize.

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:07.030
But we'll be living together,
so I have to be nice.

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:10.270
This way, Dio.
I'll show you your room.

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:10.650
Yes, sir.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.020
Hands off!

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:23.330
No one touches my bags!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:26.980
Keep your dirty paws to yourself!
Got it?!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.590
I was trying to help!

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:29.330
No thanks!

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.220
I'll have a servant carry them.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.880
What's keeping you two?

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:36.720
Hurry along.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:38.140
Yes, sir!

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:46.280
With Dio's arrival, JoJo's happy life
spiraled into misery.

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:46.940
Begin!

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:55.620
Look at those moves!

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.240
I've never seen the like!

00:07:57.900 --> 00:07:58.620
I can't connect!

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:06.960
I'll show him how we do it in the
bad part of town, Booth Boxing style!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.210
Eat this!

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:10.630
There it is!

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:13.180
JoJo is out!

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.590
It's not over yet, JoJo!

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:21.180
I'll jam my thumb in his eye
and follow through!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:27.930
Did you see that?!

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:29.270
Dio!

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:31.420
Dio, that was amazing!

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:33.450
How did you do that?

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:37.230
It's just a new defensive technique
in boxing.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:40.410
I'll teach it to you guys as a favor.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.250
Really?

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:47.070
But don't teach it to JoJo.
He can't keep a secret.

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:48.070
He can't?

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:49.420
Thanks for the warning.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:56.760
Ever since he showed up,
everyone's turned on me!

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:04.020
Danny, you'll be my friend
no matter what Dio does.

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:18.390
Who was that?

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:21.410
I feel like I've seen her before.

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:25.160
My handkerchief!

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:30.420
In that dark time, Jonathan's heart
was spurred on by love!

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:35.800
They quickly became friends,
and Jonathan was enchanted by her.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.550
Erina.
Erina Pendleton.

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:41.050
She's an angel!

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.730
What are you doing, JoJo?

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:48.730
JoJo! You can't do that!

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:50.060
You're no good!

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.250
See you!
Bye bye!

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:07.120
Hi. Are you Erina?

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:10.630
You and JoJo look happy together.

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:13.500
I knew something was wrong.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:19.380
He's been happy
where he should be miserable.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.640
He did it!

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:33.520
That's our Dio!
He's got way more guts than we do!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:36.720
He's my idol!
I want to be him!

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:40.280
Have you and JoJo kissed yet?

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:42.780
Not yet, eh?

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.540
Your first kiss was not with him!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.910
It was with me!

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:54.280
Even if I stole it, the fact
that I kissed her is enough!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:56.860
Their little romance is over!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:00.380
He won't have a single
friend or lover!

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:05.140
Look! What is she doing?!

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:07.870
What is she thinking?

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:10.140
She's washing with puddle water!

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:12.150
You wench!

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:15.420
You're just doing that to insult me!

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:26.030
Dio, you fool! Don't lose your head
over a dumb girl!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:32.920
Dio!

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:39.250
I wouldn't use my name lightly
if I were you.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:43.520
This ends now!
I won't let you hurt her again!

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:45.850
Your fight is with me!

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:49.400
So you heard about your darling Erina?

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:51.690
I won't let you insult her!

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:54.810
You're just twisted by jealousy!

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:59.190
I'm going to pulverize him.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.760
And I'll do it fair and square.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:09.290
That way he'll know beyond a doubt
he can never beat me.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:11.580
Not in a fight, and not in life.

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:14.040
Come!

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:20.330
That's it! That felt good!

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:25.240
How could he grab me after that kick?!

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:27.260
How about some more?!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:34.060
Dio!

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:38.270
I'm going to beat you until you cry!

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:41.530
How could rubbish like him beat me?!

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:53.940
You...

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.360
You...

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:56.880
You...

00:12:57.490 --> 00:13:00.130
You have a lot of nerve, don't you?!

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:02.050
He's crying.

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.970
You filthy cur!

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:07.890
What's going on, you two?!

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:10.140
Dad!

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:14.200
Boys fight. That can't be helped.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:20.480
But JoJo, you were beating Dio while he
was down and unable to defend himself!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.400
That's not civil!

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.070
But --

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.230
No excuses!

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:26.240
To your rooms, both of you!

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:29.100
You'll both be punished later.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:38.340
Seven years passed...

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:47.800
Jonathan and Dio grew
into strong young men.

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:58.280
Dio was officially adopted,
but was slowly poisoning his new father.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:06.030
JoJo guessed Dio's plot thanks to
an old letter from Dio's old father.

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:08.240
He questioned Dio.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.590
What's going on, Dio?!

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:14.410
That bastard never had any honor!

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:18.580
I'll defend my father, and my family!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:24.460
JoJo needed an antidote
for the poison in his father.

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:27.260
So he headed for London's Ogre Street.

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:42.870
Tell me where they sell
Asian medicine around here!

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:44.070
Hey, you!

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:56.870
Don't try to bluff me, rich kid!

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:00.500
Let's dance.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.090
That went to the bone!

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:14.350
The knife threw me off,
but my hat still got you good!

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:20.640
He's a monster!

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:27.090
That was no bluff! He was prepared
to lose both legs, let alone fingers!

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:30.820
His will has overcome his pain and fear.

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:37.830
I never should have picked a fight
with a guy as tough as him!

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:50.130
S-Stop!

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:54.890
I won't allow anyone to lay
a finger on that gentleman!

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:57.370
Gentleman?

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:58.640
Tell me something.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:02.420
Why did you hold back on me?

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:07.490
A leg like yours should
have totally ruined my face.

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:17.530
I'm here for my father's sake.
So I realized you must have a family.

00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:21.040
I don't want to cause them grief.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:26.130
Is this guy for real?
He's completely naive!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:26.790
But...

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:32.840
Yes, my friends are all fine, too.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:36.700
He's a true gentleman to the core!

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:38.600
I like your style!

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:41.350
Tell me your name.

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:45.000
Jonathan Joestar.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:59.900
I'm sure JoJo is dead
in an alley by now.

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:01.910
Did he find any evidence?

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:05.390
Why can't I stop drinking?!

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:09.540
Just like that wretched father of mine!

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.990
Damn it!

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.010
Watch where you're going, idiot!

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:22.930
You won't get away with that!

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:31.090
A disgusting insect like you has a lot
of nerve to speak to me like that.

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:33.190
What an excellent opportunity.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:39.580
I'll try this on you before
I use it on JoJo.

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:42.250
What are you blabbering about?!

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:45.540
A live-body experiment!

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.090
What is that light?!

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:11.230
Was I hallucinating?

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:13.650
He's dead.

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:18.390
Just a boring little toy for torturers.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:35.300
Impossible!

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:40.800
He's alive!

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:46.730
What is he?

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:48.180
Those teeth!

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:59.480
What incredible strength!

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:12.590
I have to jump into the river.

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:20.050
So thirsty...

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:25.690
I don't know why,
but I feel terribly thirsty.

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:28.060
He's draining my blood.

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:32.060
What the...

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:36.070
So this is the mask's secret.

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:37.910
But...

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:49.050
No! I don't want the sun
to be the last thing I see!

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:08.890
The sun...

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:31.320
What's the matter?
Why is it dark in here?

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:35.500
JoJo!

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:40.880
I have proof of your devilish plot!

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:56.270
JoJo, this is selfish,
but I have a final favor to ask.

00:20:57.180 --> 00:21:01.610
Please, give me time.
Time to turn myself in.

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:04.420
I want to make amends.

00:21:04.420 --> 00:21:05.190
Dio --

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:09.660
Careful, Jonathan.
Don't trust a word that snake says.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:15.370
Who am I, you ask?
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.760
I'm Robert E. O. Speedwagon,
the meddler.

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:23.010
I was worried about Jonathan,
so I came back with him.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:28.010
Since I like you, Jonathan,
let me tell you something.

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:33.210
I was raised in squalor,
and I've seen a lot of lowlifes.

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:37.840
My nose knows the difference
between good and bad.

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:43.030
And this guy stinks worse
than a pile of puke!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:46.860
I've never met a man
as wicked as him!

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:50.490
Wicked because of circumstance? No!

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:54.000
This man was born bad!

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:59.670
This face is familiar to you, isn't it?

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:05.210
This man has testified
that he sold you the poison.

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:08.470
I've heard enough.

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:11.640
This is truly a shame.

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:16.810
Dad, you need to rest.

00:22:18.090 --> 00:22:20.560
Right, I don't want to see my son arrested.

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:22.420
JoJo, do what you must.

00:22:22.420 --> 00:22:23.070
Yes, Dad.

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:27.200
So this is the end?

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:31.450
JoJo, I want you to be the one
to handcuff me.

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:33.330
For our years together.

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:34.910
All right.

00:22:36.650 --> 00:22:38.460
Be careful, Jonathan!

00:22:38.940 --> 00:22:43.580
JoJo, being human means having limits.

00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:47.150
I've learned something.

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:54.220
The more carefully you scheme,
the more unexpected events come along.

00:22:54.960 --> 00:22:57.320
As long as you are human...

00:22:57.320 --> 00:22:59.740
What? What do you mean?!

00:22:59.740 --> 00:23:03.190
I'm throwing away my humanity, JoJo!

00:23:04.240 --> 00:23:06.480
I'm moving beyond humanity!

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:08.610
Where did you get that?

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:09.500
Watch out!

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:10.740
Shoot him now!

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:13.240
I'll use your blood, JoJo!

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:20.620
He...

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:24.120
Dad!

00:23:33.590 --> 00:23:34.600
Fire!

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:51.670
JoJo...

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:54.140
D-Dad...

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:59.060
JoJo, please don't hate Dio.

00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:01.620
I am responsible.

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:06.290
I was hard on you because
you are my real son.

00:24:06.290 --> 00:24:11.130
But in Dio's eyes, that may have been
unfair to him.

00:24:11.710 --> 00:24:15.200
That could have driven him
to do what he did.

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:21.140
Please bury him next to his father.

00:24:21.950 --> 00:24:22.890
Dad...

00:24:26.690 --> 00:24:28.960
JoJo, it's not so bad...

00:24:28.960 --> 00:24:32.460
...to die in the arms
of your own son.

00:24:41.210 --> 00:24:43.460
Sir Joestar!

00:24:45.270 --> 00:24:51.960
What a tragedy! Now his
kindness is gone from the world!

00:24:51.960 --> 00:24:52.970
No!

00:24:53.320 --> 00:24:58.890
Sir Joestar passed his noble spirit
along to Jonathan!

00:24:58.890 --> 00:25:04.980
It has become his iron will, his pride
and it will create his future!

00:25:05.350 --> 00:25:10.290
Normally I hate spoiled crybabies.

00:25:11.300 --> 00:25:13.490
But they are different.

00:25:13.490 --> 00:25:18.590
They live life with no regrets.
They're giants!

00:25:21.940 --> 00:25:24.160
T-The body!

00:25:24.160 --> 00:25:27.670
Dio Brando's body is gone!

00:25:28.880 --> 00:25:31.670
You, cop! Get away from the window!

00:25:41.690 --> 00:25:43.340
H-His head...

00:25:44.800 --> 00:25:47.850
H-He's still alive!

00:25:47.850 --> 00:25:51.070
How?! We filled him with bullets!

00:25:51.430 --> 00:25:53.430
He's coming this way!

00:25:53.430 --> 00:25:56.070
What are you waiting for?! Shoot!

00:25:57.300 --> 00:25:58.200
Don't move, Dio!

00:26:02.580 --> 00:26:04.080
Dio!

00:26:26.100 --> 00:26:29.400
He's not dead, even after that.

00:26:29.400 --> 00:26:34.690
I don't get it.
I can't understand what's happening.

00:26:34.690 --> 00:26:35.650
JoJo...

00:26:37.130 --> 00:26:44.040
This marvelous power comes from
the mask, and your father's blood!

00:26:51.410 --> 00:26:54.630
He's sucking out that man's life!

00:26:55.450 --> 00:26:59.220
Dio, just what have you become?!

00:27:14.400 --> 00:27:17.900
Stop! You don't stand a chance!

00:27:17.900 --> 00:27:21.610
Anything that powerful is a monster!

00:27:22.330 --> 00:27:23.040
You're right.

00:27:24.300 --> 00:27:26.460
Honestly, I'm scared.

00:27:26.460 --> 00:27:29.660
But Dio, I can't let you live like this.

00:27:30.040 --> 00:27:32.250
It's my fault. I'll finish it!

00:27:34.390 --> 00:27:39.250
I have to be strong.
Dio is no longer human.

00:27:39.250 --> 00:27:40.380
He's a monster!

00:27:41.010 --> 00:27:41.800
Watch out!

00:27:43.840 --> 00:27:48.810
I can't let Dio kill another person!

00:27:52.430 --> 00:27:54.060
H-He caught it!

00:27:54.930 --> 00:27:57.510
Even after it went through his hand!

00:27:58.900 --> 00:28:03.060
Wait, the hole in his head
has already healed!

00:28:03.060 --> 00:28:06.260
He's completely immortal!

00:28:06.260 --> 00:28:09.160
You're weak! So weak!

00:28:18.180 --> 00:28:19.210
Hiding?

00:28:27.680 --> 00:28:34.510
Didn't I just tell you?
Human schemes have their limits.

00:28:35.190 --> 00:28:37.690
Cease your useless struggle.

00:28:37.690 --> 00:28:41.990
Cowering behind the curtains, are we?
Come on out!

00:28:45.160 --> 00:28:47.490
It's not a scheme. It's courage!

00:28:52.830 --> 00:28:55.580
He's regenerating while he burns!

00:28:56.110 --> 00:28:59.210
Is that the source of his immortality?!

00:28:59.210 --> 00:29:01.210
This fire isn't enough!

00:29:08.030 --> 00:29:09.350
What are you doing?!

00:29:09.350 --> 00:29:13.730
Get out of here, Speedwagon!
This doesn't concern you!

00:29:31.080 --> 00:29:35.870
You can't go up!
The fire is spreading!

00:29:40.990 --> 00:29:42.630
Come on up, Dio!

00:29:51.290 --> 00:29:55.770
Dio, I won't let you go
beyond these walls!

00:29:55.770 --> 00:29:57.650
Jonathan, don't!

00:30:02.470 --> 00:30:07.030
Is he using himself as bait
to protect his friend?

00:30:08.030 --> 00:30:09.140
It doesn't matter.

00:30:12.620 --> 00:30:17.080
I'll just use your blood
to heal these burns.

00:30:17.080 --> 00:30:24.200
Fleeing up here is useless!
Falling from this high won't hurt me!

00:30:24.940 --> 00:30:29.180
Instead, now the fire has cornered you!

00:30:29.180 --> 00:30:29.980
Dad...

00:30:35.350 --> 00:30:37.310
Dad, I'll miss you.

00:30:37.700 --> 00:30:40.700
Please go to heaven
along with those flames.

00:30:40.700 --> 00:30:46.030
And then, help me accomplish my goal.

00:30:46.700 --> 00:30:49.410
Give your strength to the fire.

00:30:52.370 --> 00:30:54.080
H-Here he comes.

00:31:01.710 --> 00:31:03.420
Utterly pathetic!

00:31:04.050 --> 00:31:07.920
Suddenly, JoJo's youth
flashed through his mind!

00:31:17.510 --> 00:31:21.220
My youth...
My time with Dio...

00:31:21.680 --> 00:31:25.650
Now I'm going to settle the score
for all that time!

00:31:29.570 --> 00:31:32.910
H-How dare you!

00:31:33.620 --> 00:31:35.910
I'll let myself burn!

00:31:35.910 --> 00:31:39.910
I'll end your ambition
in exchange for my life!

00:31:41.210 --> 00:31:43.630
Goodbye, JoJo!

00:31:45.830 --> 00:31:48.960
For a second there I admired your guts.

00:31:49.520 --> 00:31:53.680
Now cry tears of joy
since you can die with your dad, fool!

00:32:03.270 --> 00:32:04.060
I can't reach!

00:32:08.570 --> 00:32:11.990
Dio, I'm back!

00:32:13.490 --> 00:32:15.400
I won't let you go!

00:32:15.400 --> 00:32:18.080
Your fate is sealed!

00:32:18.080 --> 00:32:25.880
Here! This is the knife
you killed my father with!

00:32:32.760 --> 00:32:37.080
Dad! Lend me your aid!

00:32:37.080 --> 00:32:39.860
A scream! A desperate cry!

00:32:39.860 --> 00:32:47.820
Whether at an urge from beyond or
an instinct to use his burning home...

00:32:48.550 --> 00:32:49.320
JoJo kicked!

00:32:49.320 --> 00:32:51.340
And across from that spot...

00:32:51.340 --> 00:32:52.570
What the --

00:32:54.530 --> 00:32:59.280
...was a statue of the Joestar family's
guardian angel.

00:33:03.020 --> 00:33:06.290
How could a worm like you...

00:33:06.800 --> 00:33:14.030
I completely forgot! The more you
beat him, the tougher he gets!

00:33:15.930 --> 00:33:18.150
JoJo!

00:33:19.510 --> 00:33:23.720
This wasn't what my life
was supposed to be.

00:33:30.900 --> 00:33:31.980
Jonathan!

00:33:35.360 --> 00:33:36.490
Dad...

00:33:36.980 --> 00:33:38.520
You're alive.

00:33:39.120 --> 00:33:40.490
You're alive!

00:33:41.220 --> 00:33:43.000
He...

00:33:43.560 --> 00:33:48.010
He won!

00:33:51.110 --> 00:33:55.970
Spirit! What Jonathan
needs now is spirit!

00:34:00.530 --> 00:34:01.760
What's going on?

00:34:07.390 --> 00:34:12.650
That woman! Has she been
attending to JoJo all this time?

00:34:14.020 --> 00:34:17.280
Her hands are cracked from
being wet so long.

00:34:17.280 --> 00:34:21.180
She must have cooled his burns
thousands of times!

00:34:35.410 --> 00:34:36.590
I'm glad.

00:34:37.530 --> 00:34:38.340
He's conscious!

00:34:38.650 --> 00:34:42.060
You're through the worst of it.
You'll be fine.

00:34:42.060 --> 00:34:44.590
You've been treating me?

00:34:45.990 --> 00:34:46.960
You...

00:34:47.420 --> 00:34:49.450
How could you be here?

00:34:49.910 --> 00:34:51.170
You look like...

00:34:52.260 --> 00:34:54.050
No, never mind.

00:34:55.510 --> 00:34:56.740
It couldn't be.

00:34:57.150 --> 00:34:59.410
You really look like her.

00:34:59.410 --> 00:35:01.410
Who do I look like?

00:35:01.960 --> 00:35:03.410
Erina Pendleton?

00:35:05.850 --> 00:35:08.720
It's nice to see you,
Jonathan Joestar.

00:35:09.160 --> 00:35:10.070
JoJo...

00:35:10.070 --> 00:35:12.040
Erina, you've really grown!

00:35:12.390 --> 00:35:15.050
Me? You've grown a lot more!

00:35:17.090 --> 00:35:17.970
But...

00:35:19.210 --> 00:35:22.550
It really is nice to see you again.

00:35:23.900 --> 00:35:24.560
Yeah.

00:35:29.790 --> 00:35:33.060
I wasn't cut out for that
sort of work, anyway.

00:35:33.850 --> 00:35:35.430
I'll come back later.

00:35:36.330 --> 00:35:39.260
Time for Speedwagon to play it cool.

00:35:46.600 --> 00:35:47.160
Who is he?

00:35:47.620 --> 00:35:49.310
He's been following us.

00:35:49.850 --> 00:35:51.100
Is something wrong?

00:35:51.100 --> 00:35:53.320
No, everything's fi--

00:36:01.470 --> 00:36:03.790
Mister Jonathan Joestar.

00:36:03.790 --> 00:36:07.350
And the lady is Miss Erina Pendleton.

00:36:09.030 --> 00:36:10.230
W-Who are you?!

00:36:10.610 --> 00:36:14.150
You did well to survive
against the mask's power!

00:36:18.780 --> 00:36:19.530
JoJo!

00:36:22.070 --> 00:36:26.890
That's right. Squeeze every bit of air
out of your lungs.

00:36:26.890 --> 00:36:28.050
JoJo!

00:36:29.030 --> 00:36:31.210
He's injured! How could you?!

00:36:31.600 --> 00:36:35.500
He's out of breath,
but there's no need to worry.

00:36:37.880 --> 00:36:38.500
W-What on Earth?!

00:36:40.630 --> 00:36:42.520
What's happening?

00:36:42.520 --> 00:36:44.050
I feel so...

00:36:44.460 --> 00:36:45.930
M-My arm!

00:36:45.930 --> 00:36:48.470
I am Baron Zeppeli.

00:36:48.470 --> 00:36:51.680
Courage alone won't
defeat the mask.

00:36:51.680 --> 00:36:54.250
But my arm was shattered!

00:36:56.960 --> 00:36:58.440
The pain is mostly gone.

00:36:59.140 --> 00:37:00.990
I can even lift this rock!

00:37:00.990 --> 00:37:02.690
That's incredible!

00:37:02.690 --> 00:37:07.320
W-What did you do to me?!
Who are you?!

00:37:07.320 --> 00:37:09.460
I'll show you the answer.

00:37:09.460 --> 00:37:10.660
Follow me.

00:37:10.660 --> 00:37:16.830
What you will see
will change your destiny.

00:37:32.780 --> 00:37:33.930
What's happening?

00:37:34.480 --> 00:37:37.190
L-Look at the water!

00:37:39.770 --> 00:37:41.270
Don't!

00:37:52.760 --> 00:37:55.290
T-The frog wasn't hurt!

00:37:55.840 --> 00:37:58.030
That was Sendo.

00:37:58.030 --> 00:37:59.460
S-Sendo?

00:38:00.090 --> 00:38:02.930
Hamon, or ripple energy, creates Sendo.

00:38:02.930 --> 00:38:09.350
My Hamon energy went through
the frog's body and split the rock.

00:38:10.020 --> 00:38:15.160
JoJo, I know for a fact the mask
is still intact.

00:38:15.160 --> 00:38:17.600
Dio, the mask's master, holds it!

00:38:18.000 --> 00:38:19.300
What?!

00:38:19.300 --> 00:38:21.480
Did you just say Dio?!

00:38:21.480 --> 00:38:26.240
I did!
I have sought the mask for decades!

00:38:26.240 --> 00:38:31.490
I intend to destroy the mask
and vanquish its owner!

00:38:31.920 --> 00:38:35.450
You are destined to fight
against the mask.

00:38:35.450 --> 00:38:39.190
You must master Sendo
or face certain death!

00:38:39.190 --> 00:38:41.500
And humanity will fall with you!

00:38:41.500 --> 00:38:43.230
T-This is...

00:38:43.230 --> 00:38:45.410
JoJo, what's going on?

00:38:45.410 --> 00:38:46.760
What does he want?

00:38:47.880 --> 00:38:49.260
Erina...

00:38:50.420 --> 00:38:52.760
I can't let her get involved in this.

00:38:53.650 --> 00:38:55.570
Anyone but her...

00:38:57.810 --> 00:38:59.680
A-Astounding!

00:38:59.680 --> 00:39:01.270
The blossoms!

00:39:01.270 --> 00:39:03.270
U-Unbelievable!

00:39:03.270 --> 00:39:10.090
The Hamon energy left from healing
his arm revived the blossoms!

00:39:10.090 --> 00:39:16.590
This JoJo may be an untapped
wellspring of strength and talent.

00:39:16.590 --> 00:39:21.000
This youth may be the one
who can save the world!

00:39:29.370 --> 00:39:32.890
My power is slowly returning.

00:39:33.310 --> 00:39:35.890
The food chain...

00:39:36.420 --> 00:39:40.260
Pigs feed on grass.
Humans feed on pigs.

00:39:40.260 --> 00:39:43.400
And we feed on humans.

00:39:43.850 --> 00:39:47.650
Humans are our food,
so we are the true masters.

00:39:48.300 --> 00:39:50.300
Bon appetit, Jack.

00:39:52.140 --> 00:39:55.850
I'll start with a few wicked servants.

00:39:55.850 --> 00:39:57.470
Next, the world!

00:39:57.470 --> 00:40:00.010
It will all belong to me.

00:40:00.010 --> 00:40:03.630
Humanity will kneel at my feet!

00:40:04.470 --> 00:40:08.890
JoJo studied Hamon
under the mysterious Zeppeli.

00:40:08.890 --> 00:40:12.170
His will to defeat Dio was like iron.

00:40:12.840 --> 00:40:16.930
After two weeks of intense training,

00:40:17.300 --> 00:40:23.150
Speedwagon appeared with news
of Dio's whereabouts.

00:40:24.440 --> 00:40:27.400
We're headed for Wind Knights Lot?

00:40:27.400 --> 00:40:32.590
That's right. I confirmed
that someone like Dio is there.

00:40:32.590 --> 00:40:35.930
Many have gone missing there recently.

00:40:35.930 --> 00:40:40.640
We have no time.
JoJo, your final test will be combat.

00:40:40.640 --> 00:40:43.420
Yes, sir. I'm ready to do battle.

00:40:43.780 --> 00:40:45.040
Same here!

00:40:46.890 --> 00:40:48.950
Here's the entrance to
Wind Knights Lot!

00:40:49.780 --> 00:40:52.420
We'll attack while the sun is still up.

00:40:59.500 --> 00:41:00.530
What the...?

00:41:00.530 --> 00:41:03.020
Driver, why have we stopped?!

00:41:03.450 --> 00:41:06.150
Careful, there's no sun in here!

00:41:06.460 --> 00:41:08.020
Hey, driver!

00:41:18.050 --> 00:41:19.090
Is it Dio?

00:41:19.540 --> 00:41:21.140
Where did he go?

00:41:21.780 --> 00:41:25.040
Both of you, step away from the horses.

00:41:30.340 --> 00:41:31.960
What in blazes?!

00:41:32.500 --> 00:41:36.930
This guy is crueler
and crazier than Dio!

00:41:36.930 --> 00:41:39.930
So Dio's already gathered evil minions!

00:41:42.810 --> 00:41:44.990
Stand aside, you two.

00:41:44.990 --> 00:41:46.190
I'll do the fighting.

00:41:47.700 --> 00:41:48.690
He's a zombie.

00:41:49.910 --> 00:41:53.960
They feed on the living to gain
eternal life.

00:41:53.960 --> 00:41:58.450
But they are mere puppets
that must obey their masters.

00:41:58.850 --> 00:42:03.800
I'll let you enjoy the most
exquisite terror!

00:42:03.800 --> 00:42:09.790
Once the blood has drained
from your faces, I'll drink every drop!

00:42:11.700 --> 00:42:16.680
Wriggle in despair, little worms!

00:42:29.290 --> 00:42:29.850
Here he comes!

00:42:31.940 --> 00:42:33.820
Hamon Cutter!

00:42:37.990 --> 00:42:41.580
My Hamon Cutter is far sharper
than your knives.

00:42:42.040 --> 00:42:43.820
Think of a flea.

00:42:43.820 --> 00:42:45.830
A miniscule insect, right?

00:42:47.120 --> 00:42:52.090
Despite their size, they
see fit to challenge towering humans.

00:42:52.580 --> 00:42:54.710
Should that be called courage?

00:42:55.230 --> 00:42:57.590
I don't believe so.

00:42:58.060 --> 00:43:00.090
So what is courage?

00:43:00.710 --> 00:43:05.530
Courage must know fear
and make fear its own!

00:43:05.970 --> 00:43:07.940
Fear upsets breathing!

00:43:07.940 --> 00:43:12.680
Conquer fear and your breath
will never fail you!

00:43:12.680 --> 00:43:15.680
Hamon breathing comes from courage!

00:43:15.680 --> 00:43:18.320
A good human is a brave human!

00:43:18.320 --> 00:43:21.300
Courage is a marvel of humanity!

00:43:21.300 --> 00:43:24.580
Though powerful,
zombies do not know courage!

00:43:24.580 --> 00:43:26.450
They are just like fleas!

00:43:27.220 --> 00:43:30.260
Sendo Wave Kick!

00:43:32.780 --> 00:43:37.500
My Hamon energy has disrupted
the zombie's body.

00:43:38.340 --> 00:43:41.230
He didn't even spill his wine!

00:43:41.230 --> 00:43:43.940
JoJo, you will finish him off.

00:43:43.940 --> 00:43:49.350
Destroy his entire brain.
That's the only way to kill the undead.

00:43:52.460 --> 00:43:56.690
Time for the slaughter,
you naughty little pigs!

00:43:59.460 --> 00:44:02.530
I'll dice you to bits and eat you!

00:44:05.080 --> 00:44:06.260
JoJo.

00:44:07.190 --> 00:44:15.240
You must destroy him
without spilling a single drop.

00:44:15.240 --> 00:44:18.260
Spill a drop and
even if you destroy that zombie...

00:44:18.260 --> 00:44:20.260
...I will abandon you.

00:44:21.950 --> 00:44:23.220
Understood.

00:44:26.130 --> 00:44:29.680
How fragrant!
The smell of fresh blood.

00:44:33.190 --> 00:44:36.190
These ripples! It's Hamon!

00:44:36.680 --> 00:44:38.720
The wine senses Hamon.

00:44:38.720 --> 00:44:44.330
It goes through the glass, my arm,
my body, the ground...

00:44:44.330 --> 00:44:46.810
I can feel his vibrations!

00:44:46.810 --> 00:44:49.500
The wine is a Hamon detector!

00:44:50.100 --> 00:44:51.830
My spirit trembles!

00:44:51.830 --> 00:44:53.830
I'm burning up!

00:44:53.830 --> 00:44:55.290
I've found you, zombie!

00:44:56.090 --> 00:44:57.820
Pierce this wall!

00:44:57.820 --> 00:45:01.460
Sendo Hamon Overdrive!

00:45:07.740 --> 00:45:11.060
Sounds like JoJo figured it out.

00:45:11.060 --> 00:45:15.080
The north wind has made a new Viking!

00:45:17.290 --> 00:45:20.380
The group arrived in Wind Knights Lot.

00:45:20.380 --> 00:45:24.450
They met a boy named Poco
who was under Dio's spell.

00:45:25.060 --> 00:45:29.490
JoJo used Hamon
to return the boy to normal.

00:45:29.490 --> 00:45:36.040
But Dio had planned for them
to be at a graveyard at dusk all along.

00:45:36.040 --> 00:45:38.170
Jonathan, above you!

00:45:45.380 --> 00:45:46.900
The sun is gone.

00:45:47.820 --> 00:45:50.050
Time for your lives to go with it!

00:45:50.590 --> 00:45:52.140
Dio!

00:45:54.980 --> 00:45:57.480
T-They're crawling out!

00:45:59.810 --> 00:46:01.660
So that is Dio.

00:46:01.660 --> 00:46:05.740
I see. He and his zombies
can't operate during the day.

00:46:06.090 --> 00:46:13.500
So he hypnotized the boy and lured us
to an arena where he has the advantage.

00:46:13.920 --> 00:46:17.500
A man of such guile
must not have the mask.

00:46:17.500 --> 00:46:21.000
We have to destroy him somehow!

00:46:25.750 --> 00:46:30.370
Hey, baby!
Do you plan on fighting from that perch?

00:46:30.370 --> 00:46:31.300
Come on down!

00:46:31.810 --> 00:46:34.570
You're a cocky one for an insect.

00:46:34.570 --> 00:46:36.760
I am the pinnacle of life.

00:46:36.760 --> 00:46:39.810
A new being that will create the future.

00:46:39.810 --> 00:46:43.190
I am incapable of sinking
down to a human level.

00:46:47.070 --> 00:46:52.860
This is the only scar that has yet
to heal after my fight with JoJo.

00:46:52.860 --> 00:46:54.470
Come, conjurer!

00:46:54.470 --> 00:46:58.370
Let your blood salve this wound!

00:46:58.680 --> 00:47:03.630
How many lives have you taken
to erase those scars?

00:47:04.000 --> 00:47:08.260
How many slices of bread have you eaten?

00:47:23.730 --> 00:47:26.310
Solar Hamon, shine on me!

00:47:26.310 --> 00:47:28.400
Sunlight Yellow Overdrive!

00:47:35.440 --> 00:47:37.290
How feeble!

00:47:37.600 --> 00:47:39.450
I-It's freezing!

00:47:41.050 --> 00:47:42.080
No!

00:47:47.170 --> 00:47:49.230
Zeppeli was it?

00:47:49.230 --> 00:47:53.390
Your energy comes
from the flow of your blood.

00:47:53.750 --> 00:47:58.220
So if your blood vessels are frozen,
you're powerless.

00:47:58.590 --> 00:48:03.410
Know that I have absolute control
over my body.

00:48:03.820 --> 00:48:07.130
I vaporized the moisture in my left arm.

00:48:07.130 --> 00:48:12.950
When it vaporized, it sucked up heat,
flash freezing your arm.

00:48:12.950 --> 00:48:13.870
And now!

00:48:20.080 --> 00:48:23.120
Dio, I'm ending your madness!

00:48:24.080 --> 00:48:25.040
JoJo!

00:48:26.500 --> 00:48:28.550
Take this, Dio!

00:48:39.290 --> 00:48:40.180
Baron Zeppeli!

00:48:44.580 --> 00:48:46.060
T-This can't be!

00:48:53.070 --> 00:48:56.860
He can't be stopped without
solar Hamon!

00:48:56.860 --> 00:48:58.950
Can we stand against him?!

00:48:59.850 --> 00:49:01.210
Hamon?

00:49:01.740 --> 00:49:03.720
A breathing trick?

00:49:04.950 --> 00:49:06.540
If you want to huff and puff...

00:49:07.590 --> 00:49:09.300
That shaking!

00:49:09.300 --> 00:49:13.470
...then you should trumpet
a fanfare in my honor!

00:49:13.930 --> 00:49:15.840
Tarukus! Black Knight Blueford!

00:49:16.420 --> 00:49:19.590
This fight is beneath me. Arise!

00:49:19.590 --> 00:49:23.270
Make their screams
a fanfare dedicated to me!

00:49:28.620 --> 00:49:30.940
W-Who are these creeps?!

00:49:33.950 --> 00:49:35.570
Settle this!

00:49:35.570 --> 00:49:39.430
I leave the extermination
of these pests to you!

00:49:39.430 --> 00:49:40.660
Enjoy.

00:49:43.980 --> 00:49:47.250
Those two zombies are moving for JoJo!

00:49:50.170 --> 00:49:53.340
T-There's no way he can handle both.

00:49:53.340 --> 00:49:55.810
If I had a little circulation...

00:49:55.810 --> 00:49:57.190
Then what?

00:49:57.190 --> 00:49:59.700
I could heal my arm a bit.

00:49:59.700 --> 00:50:03.430
Is there some way to thaw my arm?

00:50:06.030 --> 00:50:10.520
Zeppeli, you need to heat up
your arm, right?

00:50:10.520 --> 00:50:12.730
Y-You have a plan?!

00:50:14.350 --> 00:50:16.740
How about this?!

00:50:16.740 --> 00:50:18.570
Speedwagon!

00:50:19.610 --> 00:50:25.960
In the Arctic, people treat frostbite
by putting the wound inside a seal!

00:50:29.480 --> 00:50:33.240
He's got both arms behind his back!

00:50:33.240 --> 00:50:36.340
Which will he attack with?
Or will he kick?

00:50:37.190 --> 00:50:39.140
No! He uses his hair!

00:50:39.520 --> 00:50:41.100
N-No!

00:50:44.100 --> 00:50:49.200
You've got a keen eye
if you dodged my hair's Danse Macabre.

00:50:49.200 --> 00:50:50.020
I'm enjoying this.

00:50:58.910 --> 00:51:02.920
I-I need to breathe to create Hamon!

00:51:02.920 --> 00:51:04.290
Just one breath!

00:51:04.290 --> 00:51:07.240
Now swim for the surface, boy.

00:51:07.240 --> 00:51:12.800
You can't breathe down here,
and my armor weighs me down.

00:51:12.800 --> 00:51:16.550
I won't use my sword.
This is a duel between heroes!

00:51:18.440 --> 00:51:21.930
You need to make your move
before you drown!

00:51:23.180 --> 00:51:29.310
As death threatened to take JoJo,
his explosive inner reserves awakened!

00:51:30.120 --> 00:51:35.400
An ordinary man, his lungs screaming
for breath, would swim upward.

00:51:35.400 --> 00:51:37.070
But not JoJo!

00:51:37.590 --> 00:51:42.200
Instead, he turned and swam
deeper toward the bottom!

00:51:42.820 --> 00:51:45.210
W-What is he thinking?

00:51:47.240 --> 00:51:50.140
Wind Knights Lot is a coal town.

00:51:50.140 --> 00:51:53.920
That means the ground sunk long ago.

00:51:54.500 --> 00:51:54.920
There!

00:51:55.920 --> 00:51:59.670
There should be air trapped
under the rocks!

00:52:00.380 --> 00:52:01.620
I found it!

00:52:01.620 --> 00:52:06.430
With just one breath,
my blood's beat has returned!

00:52:06.430 --> 00:52:08.100
I-Impossible!

00:52:08.510 --> 00:52:11.850
The tables have turned on you!

00:52:12.340 --> 00:52:15.860
Hamon will travel even better down here!

00:52:16.520 --> 00:52:18.340
Underwater...

00:52:18.340 --> 00:52:23.310
Turquoise Blue Overdrive!

00:52:25.280 --> 00:52:25.780
Jo--

00:52:25.780 --> 00:52:27.200
JoJo!

00:52:27.200 --> 00:52:28.740
H-He did it!

00:52:29.080 --> 00:52:30.250
It's not over!

00:52:30.730 --> 00:52:36.380
I can't believe he outswam
Hamon traveling underwater!

00:52:36.380 --> 00:52:41.040
He's like lightning.
My Overdrive only scraped his head.

00:52:42.050 --> 00:52:46.800
It'll take a solid punch
to send Hamon directly into him!

00:52:49.850 --> 00:52:53.730
Overdrive Barrage!

00:52:58.130 --> 00:52:59.150
JoJo!

00:53:06.660 --> 00:53:11.290
T-This is bad. Hamon can only be
projected from the extremities!

00:53:11.290 --> 00:53:17.340
He can't cut Blueford's hair
with his arms tied up like that!

00:53:17.340 --> 00:53:21.260
I-I want to help him,
but we have our own problem!

00:53:22.250 --> 00:53:25.260
Tarukus! H-He's gonna...

00:53:26.200 --> 00:53:29.580
This hair is digging into my skin!

00:53:29.580 --> 00:53:33.480
Struggling only makes it worse!
It's draining my blood!

00:53:35.900 --> 00:53:37.560
Here's the coup de grace!

00:53:37.980 --> 00:53:42.470
I'll slice off your head
and bathe in a fountain of blood!

00:53:42.470 --> 00:53:45.200
Try this instead!

00:53:46.950 --> 00:53:48.990
Metal conducts Hamon, too!

00:53:49.340 --> 00:53:52.300
Metal Silver Overdrive!

00:53:56.700 --> 00:53:58.580
My heart resonates...

00:53:58.830 --> 00:54:00.880
Heat enough to burn...

00:54:03.510 --> 00:54:06.050
My blood's beat is razor-sharp!

00:54:06.410 --> 00:54:11.140
Sunlight Yellow Overdrive!

00:54:13.320 --> 00:54:17.650
Yes! There's the sound
of flowing Hamon I'm so used to!

00:54:20.810 --> 00:54:25.240
S-Something is different about Blueford.

00:54:28.440 --> 00:54:31.490
I am the Black Knight Blueford.

00:54:32.020 --> 00:54:34.830
This pain is nothing to me!

00:54:43.370 --> 00:54:46.410
What?!
What are you doing, Jonathan?!

00:54:46.410 --> 00:54:49.180
Dodge or counter!
Why aren't you moving?!

00:54:55.400 --> 00:54:57.440
What in blazes?

00:54:57.960 --> 00:54:59.750
What are they thinking?

00:55:01.610 --> 00:55:05.000
You said this pain just now.

00:55:05.430 --> 00:55:06.540
Pain.

00:55:07.340 --> 00:55:09.700
You feel pain.

00:55:11.440 --> 00:55:13.450
T-The flowers!

00:55:13.990 --> 00:55:16.350
They're blooming at his feet.

00:55:16.350 --> 00:55:21.930
Black Knight Blueford's body
is being ravaged by Hamon.

00:55:25.400 --> 00:55:28.940
But pain has returned to him.

00:55:28.940 --> 00:55:31.010
The pain of being human.

00:55:31.750 --> 00:55:35.780
As Hamon destroys his zombie form,
it is restoring his noble human soul.

00:55:35.780 --> 00:55:39.480
You believed I would stop my attack.

00:55:39.920 --> 00:55:44.150
Your trust kept you
from counterattacking.

00:55:44.860 --> 00:55:48.470
Is your faith in humans so strong?

00:55:48.470 --> 00:55:51.350
This pain means I'm alive.

00:55:54.840 --> 00:55:58.030
If I can feel pain,
I can feel joy as well.

00:55:58.030 --> 00:56:02.330
This is humanity.

00:56:03.000 --> 00:56:08.450
I am filled with an odd tranquility.

00:56:09.400 --> 00:56:11.720
I feel no bitterness.

00:56:12.200 --> 00:56:19.730
Here, at the end, I have met
a marvelous man of true compassion.

00:56:19.730 --> 00:56:22.630
I shall now return to my queen.

00:56:25.900 --> 00:56:31.780
Companion of a world 300 years
younger than mine, tell me your name.

00:56:32.390 --> 00:56:34.780
Jonathan Joestar.

00:56:35.530 --> 00:56:42.290
Jonathan, I grant you the word engraved
into the sword given to me by my queen:

00:56:42.900 --> 00:56:44.290
Luck.

00:56:44.670 --> 00:56:49.130
And for your future, I grant you this:

00:56:49.130 --> 00:56:50.840
Pluck!

00:56:51.440 --> 00:56:52.570
Sir Blueford!

00:57:04.370 --> 00:57:06.770
JoJo! Behind you!

00:57:06.770 --> 00:57:07.570
Tarukus!

00:57:09.580 --> 00:57:11.040
W-What the?!

00:57:11.040 --> 00:57:16.370
How could he heartlessly stomp the armor
of his dear deceased friend?!

00:57:16.370 --> 00:57:18.580
Blueford, you spineless dog!

00:57:19.020 --> 00:57:22.830
I admired him,
but cunning was his game...

00:57:23.660 --> 00:57:26.580
...while I chose to be
a master of slaughter!

00:57:27.190 --> 00:57:31.590
I crush, kill and destroy
using brute force alone!

00:57:32.130 --> 00:57:34.340
Let me hear your anguished cries!

00:57:41.020 --> 00:57:42.640
The cliff is crumbling!

00:57:45.350 --> 00:57:46.650
These leaves...

00:57:47.110 --> 00:57:48.190
JoJo!

00:57:48.190 --> 00:57:48.900
Yes, sir!

00:57:53.220 --> 00:57:56.740
Life Magnetism Overdrive!

00:58:01.210 --> 00:58:03.910
Grab on, Speedwagon, Poco!

00:58:12.550 --> 00:58:13.800
Amazing!

00:58:16.260 --> 00:58:18.300
You have a lot of tricks!

00:58:18.300 --> 00:58:21.730
Are you guys, uh, human?

00:58:21.730 --> 00:58:24.950
Were you sent down from heaven?

00:58:24.950 --> 00:58:29.360
I've been wondering that, myself!
I'm totally baffled!

00:58:29.360 --> 00:58:33.190
And Baron Zeppeli,
you're the biggest mystery of all!

00:58:33.190 --> 00:58:36.660
Where did you learn to do this?!

00:58:42.550 --> 00:58:46.160
T-That sound.
Is that Hamon, too?

00:58:46.160 --> 00:58:47.960
I-It's not!

00:58:47.960 --> 00:58:49.710
It's Tarukus!

00:58:53.670 --> 00:58:54.730
What's that?!

00:58:54.730 --> 00:58:57.300
T-The old knights' training ground!

00:58:57.610 --> 00:59:01.010
Jump for it before
Tarukus knocks us down!

00:59:11.860 --> 00:59:14.230
H-He's a machine!

00:59:14.230 --> 00:59:16.490
He lives only for fighting.

00:59:16.830 --> 00:59:19.890
His bones should've been
powdered by that!

00:59:19.890 --> 00:59:21.490
He's climbing up!

00:59:21.490 --> 00:59:26.910
Our goal is to destroy Dio,
but he insists on getting in our way.

00:59:26.910 --> 00:59:29.470
We will eliminate Tarukus here!

00:59:30.220 --> 00:59:34.500
JoJo, take the boy
somewhere safe inside!

00:59:47.480 --> 00:59:50.580
There's something strange
about this door.

00:59:50.580 --> 00:59:54.770
C-Careful! These ruins
are where the knights trained to kill.

00:59:55.310 --> 00:59:57.480
They say it's full of traps!

00:59:58.610 --> 01:00:01.360
Jonathan! Something's coming!

01:00:03.500 --> 01:00:04.340
Oh, no!

01:00:04.340 --> 01:00:04.950
JoJo!

01:00:09.600 --> 01:00:10.790
W-What is this?!

01:00:13.800 --> 01:00:14.970
Tarukus!

01:00:16.090 --> 01:00:21.100
The Lair of the Two-headed Dragon.

01:00:21.100 --> 01:00:24.050
A chain death match after
300 years of boredom sounds perfect.

01:00:29.910 --> 01:00:33.650
S-Stop, Baron Zeppeli!
It's just too thick!

01:00:34.510 --> 01:00:37.900
Y-Yikes!
He's ruined his hands!

01:00:38.280 --> 01:00:43.610
U-Unfortunately Hamon cannot
be used for destruction.

01:00:43.610 --> 01:00:47.080
Bricks I can handle, but not this door.

01:00:47.080 --> 01:00:53.450
JoJo is the same.
He cannot break the chain holding him!

01:00:53.450 --> 01:00:59.550
The key to the collar on your neck
is right here!

01:01:01.180 --> 01:01:05.620
The doors can't be opened
from the outside during a match.

01:01:05.620 --> 01:01:09.560
The key to my collar is on yours.

01:01:09.870 --> 01:01:14.400
That means that taking the head
of your opponent...

01:01:15.440 --> 01:01:17.690
...is the only way out of here!

01:01:20.320 --> 01:01:22.460
Overdrive!

01:01:30.840 --> 01:01:36.430
T-The chain is touching the ceiling
so Hamon won't flow into Tarukus!

01:01:42.870 --> 01:01:45.050
My left humerus is cracked.

01:01:48.360 --> 01:01:49.350
JoJo!

01:01:50.760 --> 01:01:54.600
D-Damn!
I wet my pants!

01:01:54.970 --> 01:01:58.370
I-I have to get away from these guys!

01:01:58.370 --> 01:02:02.610
They've brought disaster to my town!

01:02:03.620 --> 01:02:05.720
Baron Zeppeli, that lever!

01:02:05.720 --> 01:02:08.870
The door can be opened from the inside!

01:02:08.870 --> 01:02:13.190
I don't care how!
We have to find a way to join him!

01:02:14.120 --> 01:02:15.960
I don't see any way in!

01:02:21.960 --> 01:02:23.290
It's too small.

01:02:23.750 --> 01:02:26.480
They could never fit through.

01:02:27.260 --> 01:02:28.220
But...

01:02:30.260 --> 01:02:31.500
...maybe I could.

01:02:35.350 --> 01:02:36.300
Blast it!

01:02:36.300 --> 01:02:38.360
We can't get the door open.

01:02:38.360 --> 01:02:42.520
We'll have to use the cliff entrance
Tarukus used.

01:02:42.520 --> 01:02:45.670
B-But that'll take too much time!

01:02:45.670 --> 01:02:47.950
We've got no other option.

01:02:50.980 --> 01:02:53.330
I'm always on the sidelines!

01:02:53.790 --> 01:02:55.540
I'm powerless!

01:02:55.540 --> 01:02:57.510
I can do nothing to help!

01:02:57.930 --> 01:03:00.580
Look at me, Poco!

01:03:00.580 --> 01:03:03.000
I said look at me!

01:03:09.800 --> 01:03:10.980
U-Uh oh!

01:03:13.720 --> 01:03:15.630
L-Let's get outta here!

01:03:18.220 --> 01:03:19.810
S-Sis...

01:03:20.190 --> 01:03:23.690
Taking it from those bullies again?

01:03:24.740 --> 01:03:29.010
Come on, now.
Why don't you try standing up to them?

01:03:29.010 --> 01:03:32.060
I-I'll fight them...tomorrow!

01:03:32.520 --> 01:03:34.620
So when is tomorrow?

01:03:34.620 --> 01:03:36.460
Um, tomorrow.

01:03:38.920 --> 01:03:40.080
Poco...

01:03:40.750 --> 01:03:43.350
What is the scariest thing to you?

01:03:47.670 --> 01:03:49.980
Is it that sting you feel?

01:03:50.410 --> 01:03:51.870
Is pain scary?

01:03:53.410 --> 01:03:59.060
Don't you think growing up
being unable to do anything...

01:03:59.060 --> 01:04:01.140
...would be scarier than pain?

01:04:02.650 --> 01:04:04.650
I-I...

01:04:07.400 --> 01:04:09.280
Relax, baby brother.

01:04:10.700 --> 01:04:13.410
I'll do the laundry when we get home.

01:04:22.420 --> 01:04:23.350
Poco!

01:04:24.130 --> 01:04:25.460
A window!

01:04:25.460 --> 01:04:29.590
Hey! Don't go in there, you fool!

01:04:30.060 --> 01:04:36.760
Stop him! Tarukus would butcher a man
going in there, let alone a child!

01:04:36.760 --> 01:04:39.800
Listen, kid! It's too dangerous!

01:04:44.020 --> 01:04:48.220
Think what will happen
if those monsters win!

01:04:48.220 --> 01:04:52.400
If that big JoJo guy dies,
they'll attack our town!

01:04:53.090 --> 01:04:54.910
They'll attack Sis!

01:04:57.360 --> 01:05:00.670
I have to be the one to protect Sis!

01:05:02.290 --> 01:05:06.540
Sis! Tomorrow is now!

01:05:07.000 --> 01:05:08.990
Stay back! It's not safe!

01:05:08.990 --> 01:05:12.760
Keep out of this, brat!

01:05:18.560 --> 01:05:20.310
Poco!

01:05:21.300 --> 01:05:24.040
Pain isn't...

01:05:24.040 --> 01:05:26.770
...what's scary.

01:05:37.970 --> 01:05:39.790
I did it.

01:05:43.320 --> 01:05:45.790
You did well, Poco.

01:05:45.790 --> 01:05:48.420
Don't worry, you're not that hurt.

01:05:49.850 --> 01:05:53.810
Now, Baron Zeppeli!
Go in there and crush him!

01:06:02.600 --> 01:06:08.770
You will soon be ready for the training
we call the Celestial Gate.

01:06:09.080 --> 01:06:12.040
However, I tell you again, Zeppeli...

01:06:12.040 --> 01:06:18.780
...if you continue your training, you
will not be able to escape your doom.

01:06:19.720 --> 01:06:21.830
Master Tonpetty...

01:06:22.650 --> 01:06:26.800
...please read the waves
of my life once more.

01:06:27.480 --> 01:06:30.130
How am I destined to die?

01:06:30.930 --> 01:06:32.840
What would you do if you knew?

01:06:33.740 --> 01:06:39.760
I have a purpose in my life.
I cannot set it aside.

01:06:40.210 --> 01:06:43.850
I want to know in order to
fulfill that purpose.

01:06:44.790 --> 01:06:49.350
I will accept everything
when I know when I will die.

01:06:50.290 --> 01:06:52.360
I will be satisfied.

01:06:53.400 --> 01:06:57.740
Very well, if you feel
you are prepared...

01:06:58.230 --> 01:06:59.570
...I will tell you.

01:07:09.680 --> 01:07:14.430
In an ancient, hidden chamber
that reeks of death...

01:07:14.430 --> 01:07:18.180
...a child will open the way.

01:07:18.180 --> 01:07:23.460
In order to release a chained
young lion into the future...

01:07:23.460 --> 01:07:32.080
...you will burn your own wounds
and after, a cruel death awaits you!

01:07:37.220 --> 01:07:38.710
Baron Zeppeli...

01:07:39.400 --> 01:07:41.110
Be careful, Baron!

01:07:45.560 --> 01:07:46.910
Here I come, JoJo!

01:07:51.470 --> 01:07:56.410
In order to release a chained
young lion into the future.

01:08:01.620 --> 01:08:06.060
Come, fools! You want to hit me
with some of your Hamon?

01:08:06.550 --> 01:08:10.870
You cowards won't be able
to lay a finger on me!

01:08:12.870 --> 01:08:15.340
What's the matter? Scared stiff?

01:08:25.120 --> 01:08:26.910
Well done, Baron Zeppeli!

01:08:35.880 --> 01:08:36.610
Try this, Tarukus!

01:08:37.140 --> 01:08:39.090
Tornado Overdrive!

01:08:40.800 --> 01:08:41.680
H-He just...!

01:08:44.050 --> 01:08:45.110
Above me?

01:08:45.110 --> 01:08:47.180
No, the chain is coming from below!

01:08:49.930 --> 01:08:53.350
I call this the Hell Heaven Snake Kill!

01:09:00.490 --> 01:09:02.990
I'll strangle you both to death!

01:09:24.070 --> 01:09:24.970
Jo...

01:09:25.880 --> 01:09:28.760
JoJo...

01:09:43.690 --> 01:09:45.690
Th-This is...

01:09:46.230 --> 01:09:49.140
This is just too cruel!

01:10:07.880 --> 01:10:08.760
Jonathan!

01:10:11.980 --> 01:10:16.770
Still alive, even with
a broken neck, are you?

01:10:17.620 --> 01:10:19.560
Allow me to finish you.

01:10:26.820 --> 01:10:27.790
Jo...

01:10:28.480 --> 01:10:29.490
JoJo...

01:10:31.490 --> 01:10:33.790
The other one is still alive, too?

01:10:35.280 --> 01:10:37.040
My ultimate...

01:10:38.140 --> 01:10:39.790
My ultimate...

01:10:41.180 --> 01:10:45.170
My ultimate technique
is now yours, JoJo!

01:10:47.100 --> 01:10:51.390
JoJo, please, take up my torch!

01:10:54.630 --> 01:10:57.890
Ultimate Deep Pass Overdrive!

01:11:20.420 --> 01:11:27.210
JoJo, I have given you
all of my life energy.

01:11:30.150 --> 01:11:32.570
B-Baron...

01:11:34.470 --> 01:11:38.070
B-Baron Zeppeli!

01:11:46.740 --> 01:11:52.070
I'll grind both of you into paste
beneath my boot!

01:12:02.630 --> 01:12:04.960
Y-You...

01:12:06.960 --> 01:12:10.330
Jonathan pulled Tarukus off the ground!

01:12:10.330 --> 01:12:14.350
Baron Zeppeli's Hamon
healed his broken neck!

01:12:19.880 --> 01:12:23.480
You'll pay, Tarukus!

01:12:25.560 --> 01:12:26.480
Jonathan!

01:12:28.130 --> 01:12:29.440
W-What the...?!

01:12:30.150 --> 01:12:38.330
You are utterly twisted by your madness.
You willingly sold your soul to Dio.

01:12:56.050 --> 01:13:01.520
S-Such strength!
His body can barely contain his power!

01:13:02.310 --> 01:13:08.800
Jonathan received Baron Zeppeli's power
and it has synergized with his own!

01:13:08.800 --> 01:13:13.360
Tarukus, I will allow nothing of you
to remain in this world.

01:13:14.100 --> 01:13:16.030
I will banish your evil spirit!

01:13:18.410 --> 01:13:21.910
Drown in the depths of history!

01:13:22.220 --> 01:13:24.830
Enough talk, you little brat!

01:13:28.580 --> 01:13:30.630
Your trick didn't work!

01:13:38.870 --> 01:13:39.390
It's over!

01:13:56.050 --> 01:13:57.200
Baron Zeppeli!

01:13:59.830 --> 01:14:00.950
Baron Zeppeli...

01:14:06.540 --> 01:14:07.630
I can't...

01:14:08.840 --> 01:14:10.280
I can't believe this.

01:14:13.450 --> 01:14:15.150
Without you...

01:14:16.460 --> 01:14:20.470
Without you, what will we do?

01:14:23.080 --> 01:14:26.980
JoJo, you fool!
Have you lost your wits?

01:14:28.470 --> 01:14:31.480
This is no time to grieve!

01:14:36.300 --> 01:14:38.870
Now go.

01:14:39.580 --> 01:14:42.700
Defeat Dio.

01:14:44.430 --> 01:14:48.590
Destroy the mask.

01:14:48.590 --> 01:14:49.210
Baron Zeppeli!

01:14:56.570 --> 01:14:57.900
I...

01:14:58.450 --> 01:15:03.560
I am satisfied with my fate.

01:15:07.220 --> 01:15:13.340
In the end, I passed along
all of myself.

01:15:15.330 --> 01:15:16.400
JoJo...

01:15:17.640 --> 01:15:20.490
...you are my hope.

01:15:21.290 --> 01:15:22.430
Baron Zeppeli...

01:15:23.800 --> 01:15:29.550
You feel like both a son
and a best friend to me.

01:15:30.870 --> 01:15:35.200
And now I will live on...

01:15:35.200 --> 01:15:38.810
...within you.

01:15:50.240 --> 01:15:55.690
The 19th century novelist
William Thackeray wrote this:

01:15:56.780 --> 01:16:00.550
To love and win is the best thing.

01:16:01.630 --> 01:16:06.700
To love and lose is the next best.

01:16:10.600 --> 01:16:18.080
So JoJo took up his mentor's
life's quest as well as his spirit.

01:16:22.270 --> 01:16:26.840
Having lost Zeppeli,
JoJo and company head for Dio's castle.

01:16:27.480 --> 01:16:33.060
They confirm Dio has taken over
as they fight off zombie townspeople.

01:16:34.330 --> 01:16:38.150
Suddenly, they are assaulted
by Hamon-users.

01:16:38.150 --> 01:16:43.800
But they are actually Zeppeli's
old companions who have come to help.

01:16:44.940 --> 01:16:46.660
My name is Dire.

01:16:47.250 --> 01:16:49.510
I am Straizo.

01:16:49.510 --> 01:16:50.750
Look at this.

01:16:52.070 --> 01:16:53.190
A letter...

01:16:53.740 --> 01:16:55.250
It's from...

01:16:55.780 --> 01:16:56.750
...Baron Zeppeli!

01:16:57.580 --> 01:17:02.420
He sent that letter to request our aid.

01:17:02.420 --> 01:17:08.850
He wrote about the location of the mask
and the man who bears it.

01:17:15.240 --> 01:17:17.590
This is our master, Tonpetty.

01:17:23.140 --> 01:17:25.570
A pleasure to meet you.

01:17:25.570 --> 01:17:30.540
You're Baron Zeppeli's teacher,
Master Tonpetty.

01:17:34.080 --> 01:17:38.750
Where I come from,
shaking hands is not a custom.

01:17:39.190 --> 01:17:41.260
We greet each other this way.

01:17:49.760 --> 01:17:53.600
And where is Zeppeli now?

01:17:56.380 --> 01:18:00.360
I see. Zeppeli has passed.

01:18:02.050 --> 01:18:07.870
Even if we had come earlier,
his fate would not have changed.

01:18:09.510 --> 01:18:15.370
But this Dio's power is overwhelming!

01:18:17.150 --> 01:18:21.770
His wicked might is quite extraordinary.

01:18:38.180 --> 01:18:41.070
I'm back from hell, Dio.

01:18:41.850 --> 01:18:45.020
Still alive, JoJo?

01:18:45.570 --> 01:18:50.940
I suppose that means
you've defeated my two knights.

01:18:51.500 --> 01:18:56.580
Lord Dio, we await your order
to eliminate him!

01:18:57.010 --> 01:18:57.790
Dio!

01:18:58.460 --> 01:19:00.840
No. This one...

01:19:01.180 --> 01:19:03.710
This one I will handle personally.

01:19:04.500 --> 01:19:06.670
Allow me to be frank, JoJo.

01:19:08.040 --> 01:19:12.160
I didn't want to have
to do this personally.

01:19:12.160 --> 01:19:18.770
We were raised in the same house.
Making you undead does not please me.

01:19:18.770 --> 01:19:22.110
That's why I left this business
to my knights.

01:19:23.380 --> 01:19:27.480
But in the end, I underestimated you.

01:19:27.930 --> 01:19:34.750
Seeing you alive makes me realize
I was too soft of an emperor.

01:19:35.580 --> 01:19:40.830
Now I will slaughter you
without a hint of hesitation!

01:19:41.500 --> 01:19:45.630
Same here.
I'll feel no guilt for killing you!

01:19:45.630 --> 01:19:52.280
By the way, what happened to that dapper
mustachioed gentleman you were with?

01:19:52.280 --> 01:19:53.720
Did he run off?

01:19:55.080 --> 01:20:00.020
Dio, I must express my feelings.
This shames me as a gentleman, but...

01:20:00.700 --> 01:20:07.900
...truth be told, I, Jonathan Joestar,
will kill you to satisfy my anger!

01:20:11.690 --> 01:20:13.490
Come, JoJo!

01:20:17.640 --> 01:20:19.370
Dire!

01:20:19.370 --> 01:20:21.720
JoJo, stand aside.

01:20:22.260 --> 01:20:26.170
I have the right to satisfy
my anger first.

01:20:26.730 --> 01:20:31.840
Zeppeli was a companion through
two decades of harsh training.

01:20:32.150 --> 01:20:36.860
Wait! He has hidden abilities
you don't know about!

01:20:47.790 --> 01:20:49.690
You fell for it, fool!

01:20:49.690 --> 01:20:52.280
Thunder Cross Split Attack!

01:20:59.620 --> 01:21:02.040
Useless! Useless! Useless!

01:21:03.860 --> 01:21:04.960
I-I can't move!

01:21:06.040 --> 01:21:07.210
He was flash frozen!

01:21:07.880 --> 01:21:10.170
Y-You...

01:21:10.170 --> 01:21:12.640
So feeble!

01:21:12.640 --> 01:21:17.590
You thought you would ever
be able to touch me, fool?!

01:21:17.590 --> 01:21:21.310
You came here just to die like a dog!

01:21:21.310 --> 01:21:25.060
I'll give them all a good show!

01:21:25.060 --> 01:21:26.810
D-Dire!

01:21:25.990 --> 01:21:27.670
Stop!

01:21:37.900 --> 01:21:39.920
JoJo, it's time.

01:21:39.920 --> 01:21:43.000
You're the next one
to be sent to oblivion!

01:21:49.230 --> 01:21:52.350
A Hamon-filled rose's thorns do sting.

01:21:54.600 --> 01:21:56.050
Dire!

01:21:58.940 --> 01:22:00.230
How...

01:22:00.230 --> 01:22:03.770
How dare you scar my face?!

01:22:04.240 --> 01:22:05.480
Dire...

01:22:09.930 --> 01:22:11.130
Speedwagon!

01:22:11.130 --> 01:22:11.780
Here!

01:22:15.150 --> 01:22:18.660
Dio, I've just seen the way
to beat your flash freezing.

01:22:18.660 --> 01:22:26.540
I know how to send Hamon into you.
Dire spent his life to teach me.

01:22:26.870 --> 01:22:31.920
I'll fill Blueford's sword of luck and
pluck with Hamon and slice you!

01:22:36.120 --> 01:22:38.240
You dare touch me...

01:22:38.240 --> 01:22:44.810
You dare touch me with your
Hamon filthier than frog urine?!

01:22:44.810 --> 01:22:47.510
You've pushed your luck too far!

01:22:48.690 --> 01:22:52.190
Now you'll be a feast for my zombies!

01:22:52.190 --> 01:22:55.320
They'll gnaw the faces off your skulls!

01:22:55.320 --> 01:22:59.950
Now he shows his true colors
as the worst man in the world!

01:23:00.300 --> 01:23:04.720
His cool sophistication is
nothing but a cheap mask!

01:23:04.720 --> 01:23:11.290
Now that he's had a humiliating taste
of Hamon, we see his real face!

01:23:14.010 --> 01:23:15.920
There are so many.

01:23:15.920 --> 01:23:18.550
I will show them no mercy!

01:23:19.220 --> 01:23:22.380
We'll handle these zombies.

01:23:40.240 --> 01:23:43.240
I'll squeeze the life out of you!

01:23:43.240 --> 01:23:46.830
I'll cleanse the world of your evil!

01:23:48.040 --> 01:23:51.210
H-He grabbed some roses
when I wasn't looking!

01:23:54.930 --> 01:23:55.760
Now!

01:23:56.670 --> 01:23:59.880
D-Damn! JoJo is a veteran fighter!

01:24:06.020 --> 01:24:06.770
Yes!

01:24:10.900 --> 01:24:13.950
He finally defeated Dio!

01:24:16.570 --> 01:24:18.150
Wrong!

01:24:18.710 --> 01:24:19.650
You fools!

01:24:21.280 --> 01:24:22.680
I-I...

01:24:23.430 --> 01:24:25.330
I'm frozen!

01:24:25.890 --> 01:24:27.700
So feeble!

01:24:30.180 --> 01:24:33.710
Now you will become
one of my children of the night!

01:24:37.930 --> 01:24:41.590
I've got your rubbery
carotid between my fingers!

01:24:41.930 --> 01:24:46.590
So warm and springy.
What a pleasant feeling.

01:24:47.050 --> 01:24:47.600
A kick!

01:24:57.050 --> 01:24:59.010
My legs are frozen, too!

01:24:59.010 --> 01:25:01.180
Useless! Useless! Useless!

01:25:01.180 --> 01:25:03.740
Enjoy this anguish, JoJo!

01:25:03.740 --> 01:25:09.950
Move and this delicate
blood vessel will snap!

01:25:09.950 --> 01:25:19.340
I'll open your carotid and exchange
your blood for my vampiric essence.

01:25:19.340 --> 01:25:21.390
W-We have to help!

01:25:22.270 --> 01:25:23.380
Zombies!

01:25:24.550 --> 01:25:27.930
Keep those peasants back
for a moment.

01:25:28.650 --> 01:25:31.480
They won't stop coming.

01:25:32.440 --> 01:25:34.270
We can't help like this.

01:25:34.600 --> 01:25:40.780
Now, JoJo, I'll fill you with vampiric
essence and make you my slave!

01:25:41.230 --> 01:25:46.860
Don't think you've won, Dio!
You've made a fatal mistake!

01:25:46.860 --> 01:25:47.740
And how so?

01:25:49.340 --> 01:25:55.000
You haven't frozen me completely
because you are still feeding.

01:25:55.000 --> 01:26:01.840
If you freeze me, my Hamon will stop,
but you can't drain my life, either!

01:26:01.840 --> 01:26:05.340
Your tactics are flawed!

01:26:06.750 --> 01:26:09.140
He put the sword in the flame!

01:26:09.570 --> 01:26:14.640
That blade is conducting the heat
faster than I can freeze it!

01:26:15.040 --> 01:26:17.900
Hamon is coming up the blade!

01:26:19.820 --> 01:26:25.110
Sunlight Yellow Overdrive!

01:26:25.700 --> 01:26:26.700
Take this!

01:26:27.120 --> 01:26:28.490
He got him!

01:26:30.210 --> 01:26:31.880
Look again!

01:26:33.260 --> 01:26:34.270
My arm...

01:26:34.700 --> 01:26:36.830
My arm is frozen again!

01:26:37.640 --> 01:26:40.170
You underestimated me, JoJo!

01:26:42.820 --> 01:26:48.440
I will admit it.
I admire your explosive tenacity.

01:26:48.440 --> 01:26:54.140
I must say that your use of fire
was marvelous.

01:26:56.510 --> 01:27:01.070
But JoJo, nothing can escape
my icy grasp.

01:27:04.430 --> 01:27:07.060
He squeezed out
the vampiric essence!

01:27:07.060 --> 01:27:10.190
Jonathan hasn't given up yet!

01:27:11.590 --> 01:27:14.490
Your Hamon training is useless!

01:27:14.490 --> 01:27:19.270
Useless! Useless! Useless! Useless!

01:27:19.270 --> 01:27:22.320
A monkey cannot stand
against a human!

01:27:22.320 --> 01:27:27.970
And compared to me,
you are a mere monkey, JoJo!

01:27:27.970 --> 01:27:32.590
Wrong! With enough conviction,
humans can do anything!

01:27:32.590 --> 01:27:36.020
Humans will grow!
Let me demonstrate!

01:27:42.240 --> 01:27:44.480
His hand, it's burning!

01:27:45.210 --> 01:27:46.860
His glove is on fire!

01:27:46.860 --> 01:27:50.610
Which one of us will fall in the end?!

01:27:50.610 --> 01:27:53.120
We find out now, Dio!

01:27:58.940 --> 01:28:00.460
H-He was blocked!

01:28:04.280 --> 01:28:04.840
No!

01:28:05.940 --> 01:28:06.800
He broke through!

01:28:19.980 --> 01:28:22.700
I'm disintegrating!

01:28:25.760 --> 01:28:28.410
The pain! The burning!

01:28:32.840 --> 01:28:40.120
My reign...was supposed...
to last...for centuries!

01:28:41.110 --> 01:28:44.090
You had to be destroyed, Dio.

01:28:45.590 --> 01:28:47.420
I won't...

01:28:56.550 --> 01:28:58.750
He shot his essence from his eye!

01:28:58.750 --> 01:29:02.520
He was centimeters
from incinerating my brain!

01:29:02.520 --> 01:29:04.630
T-That was close!

01:29:04.630 --> 01:29:08.610
The last throes of a demon
clinging to life.

01:29:10.360 --> 01:29:13.000
Dio's falling down the cliff!

01:29:29.190 --> 01:29:30.200
Dio...

01:29:34.390 --> 01:29:41.870
Joestar heir Jonathan Joestar weds
Erina, only daughter of the Pendletons!

01:29:43.000 --> 01:29:47.400
-Atlantic Ocean, en route to America-

01:29:54.010 --> 01:29:57.800
One bird all alone,
separated from its flock?

01:30:05.790 --> 01:30:06.760
Erina...

01:30:07.550 --> 01:30:08.710
Is something wrong?

01:30:13.350 --> 01:30:14.880
Why are you crying?

01:30:15.460 --> 01:30:18.300
These are tears of joy.

01:30:18.300 --> 01:30:20.100
Because I am with you.

01:30:22.420 --> 01:30:30.290
Even back then, you strove to be a true
gentleman, no matter the consequences.

01:30:30.290 --> 01:30:35.030
And now the proud
Jonathan Joestar is in my arms.

01:30:35.030 --> 01:30:37.090
I feel the same way.

01:30:37.540 --> 01:30:42.740
When my heart was frozen in despair,
you came and warmed me.

01:30:43.790 --> 01:30:49.070
I am happy to have saved a world
with you living in it.

01:30:49.070 --> 01:30:51.810
I wish Dad could've met you.

01:30:52.750 --> 01:30:55.510
Erina, let's go and eat!

01:30:55.510 --> 01:30:56.300
Jonathan!

01:31:00.020 --> 01:31:03.140
I was about to tell you
to watch your head.

01:31:10.390 --> 01:31:13.630
I hope today never ends.

01:31:23.170 --> 01:31:26.540
I couldn't. I've never had alcohol.

01:31:26.900 --> 01:31:32.360
Try a little. Just a sip.
It's not that strong.

01:31:32.920 --> 01:31:33.920
Give it a taste.

01:31:36.380 --> 01:31:37.190
Here.

01:31:56.810 --> 01:31:57.570
Jonathan?

01:31:58.570 --> 01:31:59.810
No!

01:32:00.240 --> 01:32:02.100
There's no way...

01:32:02.100 --> 01:32:04.330
Dio is...alive...

01:32:07.750 --> 01:32:12.330
Erina, go to our room and
don't forget to lock the door!

01:32:31.060 --> 01:32:32.130
Stop!

01:32:33.390 --> 01:32:34.020
You're...!

01:32:36.330 --> 01:32:39.280
Is my new body here?

01:32:39.760 --> 01:32:41.410
D-Dio!

01:32:42.000 --> 01:32:45.780
Jonathan is worried.
There's something wrong.

01:32:49.130 --> 01:32:54.040
JoJo, look.
See what has become of me.

01:32:54.780 --> 01:32:59.300
There is a reason
I come before you in this state.

01:33:00.170 --> 01:33:03.430
Why would I show you my weakness?

01:33:03.780 --> 01:33:10.040
Because, JoJo, though I once
despised you, I now respect you.

01:33:10.040 --> 01:33:15.660
I respect your courage,
your spirit and your power.

01:33:16.150 --> 01:33:17.940
I realize that now.

01:33:17.940 --> 01:33:19.190
Dio!

01:33:19.560 --> 01:33:22.980
Our two existences are truly one.

01:33:22.980 --> 01:33:31.460
I will take the body of the only man
I respect and live in eternal glory!

01:33:31.460 --> 01:33:35.180
That is the destiny laid out for me!

01:33:35.180 --> 01:33:39.670
You will feel no pain,
that is my last gift to you!

01:33:40.680 --> 01:33:41.630
His eyes!

01:33:42.200 --> 01:33:45.720
Live on as my body, JoJo!

01:33:46.430 --> 01:33:47.220
Jonathan!

01:33:48.940 --> 01:33:50.700
Erina...

01:34:02.250 --> 01:34:03.700
J-Jonathan...

01:34:04.710 --> 01:34:07.200
Eri...na...

01:34:08.840 --> 01:34:10.860
What a pity.

01:34:10.860 --> 01:34:16.210
If you had just held still,
it would have been a painless death.

01:34:17.780 --> 01:34:25.470
Torn from your fairy tale into hell,
unable to understand or even speak?

01:34:26.820 --> 01:34:31.970
Did JoJo never tell you of me,
the mythical dweller in the dark?

01:34:31.970 --> 01:34:38.680
I may not look like much, but surely
you remember me, Erina Pendleton.

01:34:39.110 --> 01:34:42.730
No, it's Mrs. Erina Joestar now,
isn't it?

01:34:43.160 --> 01:34:44.090
Dio!

01:34:47.930 --> 01:34:51.580
The ship's full of monsters!

01:35:06.540 --> 01:35:10.350
As you ordered,
I drained the life of one passenger.

01:35:10.350 --> 01:35:14.350
And now most of the ship
has joined our family!

01:35:17.020 --> 01:35:18.990
I can't speak.

01:35:18.990 --> 01:35:20.360
I can't breathe.

01:35:20.360 --> 01:35:23.190
Erina... Erina!

01:35:24.940 --> 01:35:26.570
I have to save...

01:35:30.960 --> 01:35:34.040
I can't charge my Hamon.

01:35:34.390 --> 01:35:39.990
This is what he gets for crossing you,
Lord Dio. Now it's time to play.

01:35:39.990 --> 01:35:46.330
Or shall I just wait a few minutes
for him to suffocate, hmm?

01:35:46.330 --> 01:35:48.300
Listen, Wang Chan!

01:35:48.300 --> 01:35:50.550
I'll tolerate no insult to JoJo!

01:35:51.610 --> 01:35:55.860
He is the man who brought me
to my current state.

01:35:55.860 --> 01:36:01.310
Show him some respect by severing
his head painlessly.

01:36:01.310 --> 01:36:03.770
Yes, Lord Dio.

01:36:04.910 --> 01:36:09.200
And now my dear friend's body
will become my future!

01:36:09.200 --> 01:36:09.740
Jonathan!

01:36:13.640 --> 01:36:19.660
Now I'll scoop out what little brains
you have with my fingers!

01:36:21.340 --> 01:36:23.290
Must...save Erina.

01:36:23.290 --> 01:36:29.490
I'll have to use the last bit of Hamon
left in my body all at once.

01:36:29.490 --> 01:36:30.550
A little will do.

01:36:31.620 --> 01:36:32.930
Look out, Wang Chan!

01:36:41.380 --> 01:36:47.440
S-Something broke inside of my body.
Something important.

01:36:48.370 --> 01:36:49.860
N-No!

01:36:55.480 --> 01:36:59.380
This... This is the end.

01:36:59.380 --> 01:37:01.520
My last Hamon.

01:37:01.520 --> 01:37:06.330
It was too weak to destroy
that zombie completely.

01:37:06.330 --> 01:37:08.550
But it was enough.

01:37:15.180 --> 01:37:17.100
W-What the...?!

01:37:17.100 --> 01:37:20.850
JoJo must have done something
to Wang Chan's body!

01:37:21.350 --> 01:37:26.110
He disrupted its functions
without destroying it.

01:37:26.110 --> 01:37:30.110
He's made it cling tightly
to the machinery.

01:37:30.110 --> 01:37:34.360
A-And the device it's clinging to...

01:37:35.000 --> 01:37:37.620
...is the paddle's screw shaft!

01:37:37.620 --> 01:37:41.370
It's strong enough to stop the paddle!

01:37:41.370 --> 01:37:47.420
If the shaft stops, the steam inside
the piston will keep building up!

01:37:47.420 --> 01:37:50.380
And after a while...

01:37:50.380 --> 01:37:52.390
...the ship will explode!

01:37:53.450 --> 01:37:55.890
Jonathan, this can't be.

01:37:56.790 --> 01:37:58.890
How could this happen to us?

01:37:59.330 --> 01:38:02.180
R-Run, Erina.

01:38:02.180 --> 01:38:05.890
The s-ship will explode.

01:38:11.030 --> 01:38:15.160
I don't know exactly what is going on.

01:38:15.900 --> 01:38:21.390
It's too much for me.
I don't know if I should cry or scream.

01:38:21.390 --> 01:38:25.290
Maybe I should just faint away.

01:38:26.310 --> 01:38:29.290
But I can say one thing.

01:38:30.520 --> 01:38:31.920
Erina Joestar...

01:38:34.070 --> 01:38:35.910
...will die with you.

01:38:39.430 --> 01:38:46.160
In the warmth of these lips, alas,
I feel the touch of death.

01:38:46.970 --> 01:38:49.440
Jonathan Joestar is dying.

01:38:49.820 --> 01:38:54.100
But we're together.
I want to stay like this forever.

01:38:55.910 --> 01:38:59.870
Until the ship explodes
and everything burns.

01:39:00.640 --> 01:39:03.200
Until everything is gone.

01:39:23.580 --> 01:39:26.510
It's all right to cry.

01:39:26.510 --> 01:39:31.900
But you...have to keep living.

01:39:33.290 --> 01:39:39.960
It's like a storybook!
You want me to save a baby and run?

01:39:41.560 --> 01:39:44.730
To me, that heroism is cruelty.

01:39:45.190 --> 01:39:48.920
My only wish is to die with you.

01:39:50.220 --> 01:39:55.870
That woman died to save her child.

01:39:56.450 --> 01:39:59.680
My mother did the same for me.

01:40:00.650 --> 01:40:04.760
Go with the baby. Hurry!

01:40:11.530 --> 01:40:13.820
It's starting to explode.

01:40:25.240 --> 01:40:25.950
Jonathan!

01:40:29.160 --> 01:40:30.950
It's already exploding!

01:40:30.950 --> 01:40:35.920
I have to protect myself
from the sun at all times!

01:40:35.920 --> 01:40:40.220
So I am already prepared
in the event of an explosion!

01:40:45.310 --> 01:40:47.930
Erina, take a good look!

01:40:47.930 --> 01:40:53.860
Now that JoJo can't use Hamon,
I can safely steal his body!

01:40:53.860 --> 01:40:58.460
Then I will step into that trunk,
my humble boudoir.

01:40:58.460 --> 01:41:04.500
That little shelter can withstand
a blast made by a ton of dynamite!

01:41:04.500 --> 01:41:06.320
Here I come, JoJo!

01:41:06.990 --> 01:41:11.120
And I bid you welcome,
my new, eternal body!

01:41:15.710 --> 01:41:17.340
Jonathan!

01:41:24.210 --> 01:41:24.720
Dio...

01:41:25.900 --> 01:41:31.370
Like you said, our fates might truly
be one in the same.

01:41:31.370 --> 01:41:33.610
I feel an odd warmth toward you.

01:41:34.170 --> 01:41:37.440
Now our lives are bound completely.

01:41:38.050 --> 01:41:41.190
And they will vanish
along with this ship.

01:41:43.450 --> 01:41:47.190
Fare...well...

01:41:47.980 --> 01:41:48.700
...Erina.

01:41:54.100 --> 01:41:57.200
Let me go, JoJo!

01:41:57.200 --> 01:42:00.130
Release me!
Think about it!

01:42:00.130 --> 01:42:02.670
You'd like a shot at eternity, right?

01:42:03.040 --> 01:42:07.960
I can heal your wounds!
You can live forever with Erina, JoJo!

01:42:09.250 --> 01:42:09.930
JoJo?!

01:42:13.590 --> 01:42:15.690
He... He's...

01:42:17.400 --> 01:42:18.870
He's dead.

01:42:26.260 --> 01:42:29.200
Jonathan Joestar
Died February 7, 1889

01:42:44.620 --> 01:42:49.500
Jonathan Joestar
passed away into oblivion.

01:42:51.180 --> 01:42:57.390
His life was a piece of history
invisible to ordinary people.

01:42:59.560 --> 01:43:05.990
They will never hear the tale
of his noble accomplishments.

01:43:07.260 --> 01:43:09.500
But his descendants will.

01:43:16.630 --> 01:43:24.270
The new life that was inside me
at that time will surely hear his story.

01:43:28.520 --> 01:43:33.590
Erina Joestar was rescued
soon after near the Canary Islands.

01:43:33.590 --> 01:43:38.240
And the book of the stone mask
closed for a time.

01:43:38.650 --> 01:43:44.280
But this was only the beginning
of a new adventure.

01:43:44.280 --> 01:43:47.760
Part 1: Phantom Blood -- Fin
